  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amani Africa Project on the implementation of a program on the AUPSC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1	The expected results of the Project are as follows:
The Project&#x2019;s expected effect(s) on society is to strengthened capacity of the African Union Peace and Security Council (PSC) and its member states in fulfilling the PSC&#x2019;s mandate and effective functioning of the PSC as well as more informed and engagement of stakeholders with the PSC through the policy research work of Amani Africa and its technical support 
The expected effects for the target group of the Project are (Outcome)
Outcome 1. PSC takes informed decision based on the analysis provided by Amani Africa  
Output 1.1
Insights on the PSC 
Output 1.2
Special Research Reports and Policy Briefs
Output 1.3. 
Provision of briefings, technical support and advise to members of the PSC and other stakeholders of the PSC 
Outcome 2. Enhanced knowledge on the workings and dynamics of the PSC
Output 2.1
Seminars convened by Amani in collaboration with other partners to promote policy dialogue on the works of the PSC and current issues on peace and security
Output 2.2
Specialized trainings on the work of the PSC to be conducted on the basis of the PSC Handbook to be inaugurated in 2020</narrative>
  </description>
